  "title": "have you tried these k-dogs yet??  i popped out to try a couple of th...",
  "description": "have you tried these k-dogs yet??  i popped out to try a couple of the new vegan options at wagamamas this autumn:  vegan k-dogs: crunchy corn dogs with a noodle crumb twist and sriracha + vegan turmeric mayo! would love to get these again <3 roti + raisukatsu: a saucy asian flatbread with katsu + raisukaree sauce, aka carbs with a dip! definitely share-worthy, 'cause it was a bit of a carb load for just me. 😅  shout out to wagamama 🥂 showing other chains that a 50% plant-based menu can be done & is oh so important to help tackle climate change! 🌱🌍  #wagamama #vegandelights #kdogs #vegankdogs",
